270
00:11:50,701 --> 00:11:54,081
new mother and the baby in Anatolia.

271
00:11:54,163 --> 00:11:57,198
acting as a practical mosquito net.

272
00:11:57,244 --> 00:12:02,515
Back then, germs carried by flies to

273
00:12:02,578 --> 00:12:08,931
open wounds and the newly cut umbilical

274
00:12:09,052 --> 00:12:13,451
cord were deadly.

275
00:12:13,584 --> 00:12:20,997
A red curtain acted as a physical barrier

276
00:12:21,110 --> 00:12:29,354
against these unseen germ

277
00:12:29,482 --> 00:12:32,165
carriers.

278
00:12:33,001 --> 00:12:36,719
Iron objects placed under the pillow kept

279
00:12:36,751 --> 00:12:40,791
everyone in the room on high

280
00:12:40,859 --> 00:12:43,266
alert. The presence of a knife or scissors

281
00:12:43,298 --> 00:12:44,872
reminded anyone entering that room of

282
00:12:44,901 --> 00:12:46,542
danger and stopped strangers from

283
00:12:46,588 --> 00:12:48,437
entering without control.

284
00:12:48,486 --> 00:12:51,145
While people thought they were driving away demons,

285
00:12:51,196 --> 00:12:53,485
they had actually created a basic

286
00:12:53,507 --> 00:12:55,494
quarantine area without realizing it.

287
00:12:56,201 --> 00:13:01,749
Today, modern medicine and antibiotics have

288
00:13:01,787 --> 00:13:07,223
mostly brought this danger under

289
00:13:07,305 --> 00:13:09,481
control. However, according to World Health

290
00:13:09,512 --> 00:13:10,746
Organization data, childbed fever is not

291
00:13:10,766 --> 00:13:12,169
entirely gone; especially in poor areas

292
00:13:12,205 --> 00:13:13,378
with inadequate health care, it still

293
00:13:13,409 --> 00:13:14,838
causes about ten to fifteen percent of

294
00:13:14,864 --> 00:13:16,299
maternal deaths today.

295
00:13:16,319 --> 00:13:19,324
As it is forgotten in cities thanks to hygiene,

296
00:13:19,389 --> 00:13:24,007
the red spirit is now only remembered

297
00:13:24,090 --> 00:13:28,589
as an old fairy tale.

298
00:13:29,301 --> 00:13:32,346
Still, deep in the countryside and distant

299
00:13:32,378 --> 00:13:35,628
highlands, people still put safety pins

300
00:13:35,679 --> 00:13:38,921
under new mothers' pillows and red

301
00:13:38,942 --> 00:13:40,763
There are families who cover things with veils.

302
00:13:40,796 --> 00:13:42,530
Even though science has explained the reasons,

303
00:13:42,547 --> 00:13:44,363
for thousands of years, passed down from generation to generation,

304
00:13:44,391 --> 00:13:46,476
that deep fear continues to live inside us like a genetic

305
00:13:46,493 --> 00:13:48,609
inheritance.

306
00:13:48,641 --> 00:13:50,505
Because no matter what name we give to the unknown,

307
00:13:50,531 --> 00:13:52,450
a mother's instinct to protect her child always

308
00:13:52,466 --> 00:13:53,377
stays the same.

309
00:13:54,034 --> 00:13:56,040
Perhaps the Alkarisi was never a demon coming down

310
00:13:56,079 --> 00:13:57,943
from the skies; but humanity's

311
00:13:57,986 --> 00:13:59,899
ability to turn fear into a story when facing helplessness,

312
00:13:59,938 --> 00:14:01,643
and turn that story into a shield of protection,

313
00:14:01,682 --> 00:14:03,583
went down in history as the clearest proof

314
00:14:03,611 --> 00:14:04,715
of that.

315
00:14:05,367 --> 00:14:08,433
This page is closing for now.

316
00:14:08,527 --> 00:14:11,230
See you on the next page

317
00:14:11,293 --> 00:14:12,428
of Shadow Notebook.
